  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The Biodiversity Finance Initiative &#x2013;  Phase II (BIOFIN NIGER).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The Biodiversity Finance Initiative &#x2013; BIOFIN &#x2013; was developed to provide a comprehensive methodology for governments to: 1) review the existing policy context, 2) measure expenditure levels for biodiversity, 3) calculate future financial needs and 4) design strategic plans to deploy the right mix of finance solutions, tailored to the country context.</narrative>
  </description>
